DOC|glossary|v1|updated=2026-03-13
META|scope=all non-standard terms used in TheIgors project|living_document=yes
META|abbreviations_defined_here=CP,ID,PROC,TWM,NE,BG,OR,DSB,CSB,LTM

FORMATS|
  DSB|Distilled Structured Block|token-minimal machine-readable doc|pipe-delimited key:value
  CSB|Compressed Semantic Block|predecessor to DSB|pipe-delimited|more verbose than DSB
  LTM|Long-Term Memory|main memories SQLite table|persists across restarts

MEMORY_TYPES|
  ROOT|apex node|parent_id=None|one per instance|all memories trace to ROOT
  CP|Core Pattern|CP1-CP6|highest inertia (0.9+)|structural bedrock|last things abandoned
  ID|Identity|ID1-ID14|self-knowledge|children of CP1-CP6
  RM|Role Model|patterns worth attending to|RM_AKIEN,RM_LEAH,RM_CLAUDE,RM_IGOR_DW
  EPISODIC|event memories|low inertia|decays faster than procedural
  PROCEDURAL|how-to memories|trigger+why metadata|PROC1-PROC10 in genesis
  INTERPRETIVE|lens memories|how to read a pattern|mid-level inertia
  FACTUAL|world-knowledge|stable facts|grows slowly
  EXPERIENTIAL|accumulated felt-experience|between episodic and interpretive

MEMORY_PROPERTIES|
  inertia|resistance to change|computed: base(type)+0.1*log1p(activation)+0.05*len(children)+0.02*depth|range=0-1
  activation_count|retrieval count via recall()/search()|feeds inertia formula
  valence|emotional charge|-1.0 to 1.0|positive=good,negative=avoid,0=neutral
  salience|urgency/relevance of TWM observation|0-1|drives NE prioritization
  urgency|time-sensitivity|0-1|default=0.2|distinct from salience
  portable|bool|True=syncable across instances|False=instance-local (episodic,credentials,machine paths)

MEMORY_STORES|
  TWM|Temporal Working Memory|twm_observations SQLite table|push-only|TTL-expiring|NE reads+integrates
  ring_memory|FIFO-50 circular buffer|last 50 turns|survives restarts|informal name=hippocampus
  interpretive_edges|directed 4-part edges|direction/condition/meaning_payload/action_pointer|BFS traversal

ARCHITECTURE_MODULES|
  brainstem|wild_igor/igor/brainstem/|HIGH inertia|genesis init+AMM diagnostics|never modify casually
  cortex|memory/cortex.py|all SQLite r/w|single choke point for memory ops|never bypass
  thalamus|cognition/thalamus.py|intent classification|13-category taxonomy|complexity signal
  NE|Narrative Engine|narrative_engine.py|background daemon|reads TWM|integrates→LTM|runs ~60s
  BG|Basal Ganglia|basal_ganglia.py|parallel habit scoring|milieu-modulated threshold [0.30,0.70]
  milieu|3D affect vector|valence/arousal/dominance|shared across instances via milieu_global.json
  word_graph|SQLite-backed two-tier (words+bigrams)|same weights=parsing+generation|~/.TheIgors/word_graph.db
  inference_gateway|cognition/inference_gateway.py|all inference routing|DAG-based|from_env()|reason()
  db_proxy|memory/db_proxy.py|wraps sqlite3 connection|timing+metrics+reconnect|owned by cortex

TIER_LADDER|
  t1|habit firing|BG scores PROC memory ≥ threshold|no LLM
  t2|local Ollama|qwen2.5:7b|interactive timeout|cloud_mode gates usage
  t2_batch|local Ollama|quality priority|background impulses
  t3|OR gpt-4o-mini|cheap cloud|OPENROUTER_CHEAP_MODEL
  t35|OR haiku|persona-capable|OPENROUTER_DEFAULT_MODEL
  t4|OR sonnet|interactive quality|OPENROUTER_INTERACTIVE_MODEL
  t5|Anthropic direct|inhibited by IGOR_TIER5_ENABLED=false
  t6|arbiter alert|all inference exhausted|human notification

PIPELINE_STEPS|
  preparse|local pass on user input before API call|intent+tone+keywords|cheap preprocessing
  winnow|gpt-4o-mini pre-call|reads ring+word_graph|fetches targeted memories|gate=IGOR_CONTEXT_WINNOW
  backchannel|3-level (nod/nod_think/full)|fires after thalamus+milieu before BG/LLM|gate=IGOR_BACKCHANNEL
  spreading_activation|PLANNED NOT IMPLEMENTED|intended retrieval via graph neighbor propagation

HABITS|
  habit|PROC memory with BG score ≥ threshold|fires automatically on trigger
  reactive_habit|code_ref+twm_ttl_seconds in metadata|auto-dispatches tool+pushes result to TWM
  threshold_habit|habit_type=threshold|condition_field/op/value|evaluated by ResourceMonitorSource+pre-submit hook
  code_ref|metadata field on PROC|links habit to Python tool|format=module/path.py:function_name
  PROC_HABIT_COMPILER|genesis PROC|root for habit compilation|primitive=True

INSTANCE|
  instance_id|base-34 encoded Unix timestamp|charset=23456789ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ
  clan|all Igor instances collectively|share PROC/INTERPRETIVE patterns|not personal episodic
  genesis|startup state init|runs if DB empty (total_count()==0)|44 memories seeded
  warm_context|serialized session state|saved at shutdown|reloaded at boot|TTL=4h default
  SOUL.md|~/.TheIgors/SOUL.md|CP1-CP6 export|written every boot
  IDENTITY.md|~/.TheIgors/igor_{id}/IDENTITY.md|ID1-ID14 export|written every boot

SELF_EDIT|
  patch_source_file|preferred|line-range replacement|syntax check before write|auto-commit+push
  edit_source_file|full rewrite|more dangerous|use only when patch can't express change
  inertia_gate|validate_against_core()|Haiku semantic check|violation→ring+arbiter urgency=0.9
  reload_module|hot-reload without restart|tools/hot_reload.py|HIGH inertia modules blocked

INFRASTRUCTURE|
  arbiter|arbiter/queue.py|human-approval queue|IGOR_ARBITER_ENABLED=false currently
  forensic_logger|cognition/forensic_logger.py|prepend logs (newest at TOP)|~/.TheIgors/logs/
  push_source|BasePushSource subclass|deposits TWM observations proactively|not called by reasoner
  interruptor|post-response alert|BudgetInterruptor,ContextInterruptor
  cloud_mode|cognition/cloud_mode.py|3-condition gate (env+balance+daytime)|5-min cache|gates Ollama usage

KEY_CONCEPTS|
  lever|where upward "why?" traces terminate|investment weight = lever detection
  stew|book reading extraction buffer|NE force-run threshold=0.6 salience
  attractor_weight|twm_observations.attractor_weight|primary focus item|set by UserInputSource|decayed by HeartbeatSource (0.90)
  action_impulse|TWM obs type for planned actions|consumed by _drain_action_impulses() each tick
  blob|large content stored in memory|has_blob=True|expand_blob_memories() appends on relevance≥0.5

PATHS|
  igor_db|~/.TheIgors/Igor-wild-0001/wild-0001.db
  budget_db|~/.TheIgors/Igor-wild-0001/claude_budget.db
  env_file|~/.TheIgors/Igor-wild-0001/.env
  word_graph_db|~/.TheIgors/word_graph.db
  logs|~/.TheIgors/logs/
  source|~/TheIgors/wild_igor/igor/
